<!doctype html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
:root { --navy:#0b1d4d; --brand:#1f3a8a; --acc:#3b5bdb; --ink:#14213d; --mut:#5b6478; --line:#dde3ee; --soft:#f3f6fb;
  --red:#d9480f; --green:#12805c; --pink:#db2777; }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; }
body { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", -apple-system, "PingFang TC", Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); }
/* 1920x1080; the bottom 190 px stay empty for captions */
.card { width: 1920px; height: 1080px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; padding: 120px 150px 190px; }
.chap { position: absolute; top: 44px; left: 150px; right: 150px; display: flex; gap: 10px; }
.chap span { flex: 1; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #b4bccd;
  border-top: 5px solid #e3e8f2; padding-top: 10px; }
.chap span.on { color: var(--acc); border-color: var(--acc); }
.chap span.done { color: #8a96b3; border-color: #b9c6e6; }
h1 { font-size: 68px; line-height: 1.12; margin: 40px 0 0; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -1px; font-weight: 800; }
.sub { font-size: 34px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 26px; line-height: 1.35; max-width: 1500px; }
.num { font-size: 210px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -6px; }
.src { position: absolute; left: 150px; bottom: 196px; font-size: 18px; color: #9aa3b5; }
.row { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 60px; }
.box { flex: 1; background: var(--soft); border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; padding: 38px 40px; }
.box h3 { font-size: 44px; margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--navy); }
.box p { font-size: 29px; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0; color: #2d3650; }
.x h3::before { content: "✕  "; color: var(--red); }
.ok h3::before { content: "✓  "; color: var(--green); }
.step { flex: 1; border-radius: 22px; padding: 40px; color: #fff; }
.step .n { font-size: 26px; opacity: .75; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; }
.step h3 { font-size: 64px; margin: 10px 0 18px; }
.step p { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0; opacity: .95; }
.arrow { align-self: center; font-size: 60px; color: #b4bccd; }
.navy { background: var(--navy); color: #fff; }
.navy h1 { color: #fff; }
.doc { margin-top: 70px; background: #fbf7ee; border: 2px solid #e8dfc8; border-radius: 16px; padding: 50px 60px;
  font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.7; color: #222; }
.bar { background: #111; color: #111; padding: 0 6px; border-radius: 3px; }
.hl { background: #fde2ef; border: 3px solid var(--pink); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0 8px; }
.note { margin-top: 36px; font-size: 36px; color: var(--pink); font-weight: 700; }
.stat { flex: 1; }
.stat .v { font-size: 150px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -4px; }
.stat .l { font-size: 32px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 14px; line-height: 1.3; }
.gpu { flex: 1; border: 3px solid var(--brand); border-radius: 22px; padding: 34px 40px; }
.gpu .t { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--acc); text-transform: uppercase; }
.gpu h3 { font-size: 50px; margin: 10px 0 12px; color: var(--navy); }
.gpu p { font-size: 30px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.4; color: #2d3650; }
.mx { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 32px; }
.mx th { font-size: 24px; color: var(--mut); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; padding: 0 10px 18px; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.mx th:first-child, .mx td:first-child { text-align: left; }
.mx td { padding: 14px 10px; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); text-align: center; font-weight: 700; }
.mx td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: #2d3650; }
.y { color: var(--green); } .n { color: var(--red); } .p { color: #b0b8c9; font-size: 26px; }
.mx tr.us td { background: #eef3ff; color: var(--brand); border-top: 3px solid var(--brand); }
.bars { margin-top: 46px; }
.br { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 30px; }
.br .k { width: 360px; color: #2d3650; font-weight: 600; }
.br .k small { display: block; font-size: 21px; color: var(--mut); font-weight: 400; }
.br .track { flex: 1; height: 46px; background: #f0f3f8; border-radius: 8px; position: relative; }
.br .a { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; background: #d5dae4; border-radius: 8px; }
.br .d { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 11px; height: 24px; background: var(--brand); border-radius: 6px; }
.br .v { width: 130px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand); text-align: right; }
.br.hl .k, .br.hl .v { color: var(--pink); } .br.hl .d { background: var(--pink); }
.leg { font-size: 22px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 6px; }
.leg i { display: inline-block; width: 26px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; margin: 0 8px 0 18px; vertical-align: middle; }
.cols3 { display: flex; gap: 34px; margin-top: 56px; }
.col { flex: 1; border-top: 6px solid var(--acc); padding-top: 22px; }
.col .t { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--acc); text-transform: uppercase; }
.col .v { font-size: 92px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.05; margin: 14px 0 10px; letter-spacing: -2px; }
.col p { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.35; color: #2d3650; margin: 0; }
.vs { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 50px; }
.vs > div { flex: 1; border-radius: 22px; padding: 36px 44px; }
.vs h3 { font-size: 34px; margin: 0 0 20px; }
.vs .row2 { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 32px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
.vs .row2 b { font-weight: 800; }
</style></head><body>

{% macro chap(i) %}<div class="chap">{% for c in ["The problem", "Our idea", "Live demo", "Proof", "Built on the B70", "Ready"] %}<span class="{{ 'on' if loop.index == i else ('done' if loop.index < i else '') }}">{{ loop.index }} · {{ c }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>{% endmacro %}

<section class="card navy" data-key="cover" style="padding-top:250px">
  <div style="font-size:26px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8fb3ff;font-weight:700">ASUS UGEN AI LEAGUE 2026 · FINAL</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:150px;margin-top:20px">RedactAgent</h1>
  <div class="sub" style="color:#c8d3f5;font-size:44px">Removes personal data from scanned hospital records &mdash;<br>without the records leaving the hospital.</div>
  <div style="margin-top:60px;font-size:28px;color:#dbe4ff">2&times; ASUS UGen Intel Arc Pro B70 &middot; Battlefield Thunderstorm &middot; Workplace AI</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="volume">
  {{ chap(1) }}
  <div class="num" style="margin-top:60px">3.35 million</div>
  <h1 style="margin-top:20px">hospital discharges a year in Taiwan</h1>
  <div class="sub">Each chart may be requested later &mdash; for <b>research</b>, as a <b>copy</b>, or in a <b>dispute</b>.<br>
    Before it leaves, its personal data must be removed.</div>
  <div class="src">Source: Ministry of Health and Welfare, hospital statistics 2025</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="humans">
  {{ chap(1) }}
  <div class="num" style="margin-top:60px;color:var(--red)">81%</div>
  <h1 style="margin-top:20px">of identifiers found by a single human reviewer</h1>
  <div class="sub">Done by hand today. A leak can cost up to <b>NT$15 million</b>.</div>
  <div class="src">Neamatullah et al. 2008, BMC Med Inform Decis Mak · Taiwan Personal Data Protection Act Art. 48</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="notool">
  {{ chap(1) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">No existing product fits a Taiwanese hospital</h1>
  <table class="mx">
    <tr><th style="width:36%"></th><th>Runs inside<br>the hospital</th><th>Traditional Chinese<br>+ Taiwan IDs</th><th>Scans, seals,<br>signatures</th><th>Attacks its<br>own output</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Google Cloud Sensitive Data Protection</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="p">partly</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="p">partly</td></tr><tr><td>AWS Comprehend Medical</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="p">partly</td><td class="n">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Azure Health de-identification</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="n">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Private AI</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">✕</td><td class="p">partly</td><td class="n">✕</td></tr><tr><td>Microsoft Presidio (open source)</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="p">partly</td><td class="p">partly</td><td class="n">✕</td></tr>
    <tr class="us"><td>RedactAgent</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="src">Public vendor documentation, checked 2026-11-12 (sources in docs/MARKET_RESEARCH.md)</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="idea">
  {{ chap(2) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:90px">Detect, attack, decide &mdash; all on premises</h1>
  <div class="row" style="gap:20px">
    <div class="step" style="background:#1f3a8a"><div class="n">STEP 1</div><h3>Detect</h3><p>Rules, a language model and a vision model find the personal data</p></div>
    <div class="arrow">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step" style="background:#db2777"><div class="n">STEP 2</div><h3>Attack</h3><p>An agent attacks the redacted page: can anyone still be identified?</p></div>
    <div class="arrow">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step" style="background:#12805c"><div class="n">STEP 3</div><h3>Decide</h3><p>A person approves; only then is the page released</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="combo">
  {{ chap(2) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:90px">Privacy fails on combinations</h1>
  <div class="doc"><span class="bar">Ms. Hsu</span> is a 56-year-old patient who works as
    <span class="hl">the only licensed ferry captain on Green Island</span>.</div>
  <div class="note">Name removed &mdash; but this still points to one person.</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="proof">
  {{ chap(4) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:90px">On unseen hospital documents, before human review</h1>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:80px">
    <div class="stat"><div class="v" style="color:var(--brand)">{{ hosp_recall }}</div><div class="l">of personal data removed<br>by RedactAgent</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="v" style="color:#b4bccd">81%</div><div class="l">found by a single<br>human reviewer</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="v" style="color:var(--pink)">{{ qi_recall }}</div><div class="l">of combination clues caught<br>(rules alone: 0%)</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Held-out test set v3, generated before any result was seen, never used for tuning; pixel-level scoring. Human figure: Neamatullah et al. 2008.</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="robust">
  {{ chap(4) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">Real scans are worse &mdash; recall stays above {{ robust_min }}</h1>
  <div class="bars">
  {% for r in robust %}<div class="br"><div class="k">{{ r.label }}<small>{{ r.level }}</small></div>
    <div class="track"><div class="a" style="width:{{ r.A*100 }}%"></div><div class="d" style="width:{{ r.D*100 }}%"></div></div>
    <div class="v">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.D*100) }}%</div></div>
  {% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="leg"><i style="background:#d5dae4"></i>rules only<i style="background:var(--brand)"></i>RedactAgent (recall, worst setting of each kind)</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="hardware">
  {{ chap(5) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">The dual-card agent host, built and measured</h1>
  <div class="sub" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:16px">The organisers' blueprint for the B70: card 0 runs the reasoning brain, card 1 keeps the vision model resident.</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:46px">
    <div class="gpu"><div class="t">Card 0 · reasoning brain</div><h3>gpt-oss-20b</h3><p>21B parameters in 13 GB (native MXFP4)<br>37 requests in parallel<br>detects, then attacks its own redaction</p></div>
    <div class="gpu"><div class="t">Card 1 · eyes</div><h3>Qwen2.5-VL-7B</h3><p>Always loaded<br>signatures, seals, ID photos<br>works on the same page at the same time</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sub" style="margin-top:40px;font-size:30px"><b style="color:var(--navy)">25 of 32 GB</b> used on each card &middot; both models resident &middot; nothing leaves the machine</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="model">
  {{ chap(5) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">Choosing the reasoning model with data</h1>
  <div class="sub" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:16px">Four open models on card 0, same code, unseen test pages (v2), agentic check on</div>
  <div class="bars" style="margin-top:40px">
  {% for r in tune %}<div class="br {{ 'hl' if r.final }}"><div class="k">{{ r.name }}<small>{{ r.prec }}</small></div>
    <div style="flex:1">
      <div class="track" style="height:30px;margin-bottom:8px"><div class="d" style="top:5px;height:20px;width:{{ (r.v2r-0.8)/0.2*100 }}%"></div></div>
      <div class="track" style="height:30px"><div class="d" style="top:5px;height:20px;opacity:.45;width:{{ (r.v2p-0.8)/0.2*100 }}%"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="v" style="width:300px;font-size:28px">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.v2r*100) }} recall<br><span style="opacity:.6">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.v2p*100) }} precision</span></div></div>
  {% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="leg">Bars start at 80%. gpt-oss-20b is best on recall <b>and</b> precision.</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="ocr">
  {{ chap(5) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">Speed came from measuring, not guessing</h1>
  <div class="cols3">
    <div class="col"><div class="t">Found</div><div class="v" style="font-size:64px">GPU power fell as load rose</div><p>344 CPU threads of OCR were fighting each other</p></div>
    <div class="col"><div class="t">Fixed</div><div class="v" style="font-size:64px">8 threads per OCR engine</div><p>and the two models work on each page in parallel, one card each</p></div>
    <div class="col" style="border-color:var(--green)"><div class="t" style="color:var(--green)">Result</div><div class="v" style="color:var(--green)">9&times;</div><p>faster OCR; the GPUs are no longer waiting</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="loops">
  {{ chap(5) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">A failure that only appears at scale: reasoning loops</h1>
  <div class="cols3">
    <div class="col"><div class="t">1 · Measure</div><div class="v">7 / 380</div><p>calls looped forever<br>(30 looped, 23 recovered by themselves)</p></div>
    <div class="col"><div class="t">2 · Guard</div><div class="v">2,000</div><p>tokens: a loop still running is cancelled and retried &mdash; normal answers never get there</p></div>
    <div class="col" style="border-color:var(--green)"><div class="t" style="color:var(--green)">3 · Throughput mode</div><div class="v" style="color:var(--green)">0 / 264</div><p>loops with sampling, and {{ fast_gain }} more pages per minute</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="cost">
  {{ chap(5) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:80px">{{ pages_hour }} pages an hour &mdash; what 1,000 pages cost</h1>
  <div class="vs">
    <div style="background:#eef3ff;border:3px solid var(--brand)"><h3 style="color:var(--brand)">RedactAgent on 2&times; B70</h3>
      <div class="row2"><span>Time</span><b>{{ min_per_1000 }} minutes</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Energy</span><b>{{ kwh_per_1000 }} kWh</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Per-page fee</span><b>none</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Data leaves the hospital</span><b style="color:var(--green)">never</b></div></div>
    <div style="background:var(--soft);border:2px solid var(--line)"><h3 style="color:var(--mut)">Cloud reference (AWS)</h3>
      <div class="row2"><span>Fee</span><b>&asymp; US$29.5</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Traditional Chinese</span><b style="color:var(--red)">no</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Seals and signatures</span><b style="color:var(--red)">no</b></div>
      <div class="row2"><span>Data leaves the hospital</span><b style="color:var(--red)">yes</b></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sub" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:34px">One host, one 8-hour shift: about <b style="color:var(--navy)">3 million pages a year</b> &mdash; Taiwan has 3.35 million discharges.</div>
  <div class="src">Measured on the organiser's instance (32 pages in flight, xpu-smi board power). AWS: Textract + Comprehend Medical list prices, Nov 2026.</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="ready">
  {{ chap(6) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:90px">Ready for a hospital</h1>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="box ok"><h3>Stays inside</h3><p>Nothing leaves the building; no per-page fees</p></div>
    <div class="box ok"><h3>Plugs in</h3><p>REST API or a watched folder for hospital systems</p></div>
    <div class="box ok"><h3>A person decides</h3><p>No release without recorded approval and audit log</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sub" style="margin-top:56px">Path to users: ASUS already runs medical-record AI in Taiwanese hospitals.</div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-key="next">
  {{ chap(6) }}
  <h1 style="margin-top:90px">Stage I goals: met. Next: prove adoption.</h1>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="box ok"><h3>Done</h3><p>Runs on the B70 with both models loaded; recall rose from 97.8% to {{ v1_recall }} on the Stage I test set</p></div>
    <div class="box"><h3>Next</h3><p>Reviewer study: how much faster, how many fewer misses</p></div>
    <div class="box"><h3>Next</h3><p>Pilot with a hospital records office</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card navy" data-key="outro" style="padding-top:300px">
  <h1 style="font-size:130px">RedactAgent</h1>
  <div class="sub" style="color:#c8d3f5;font-size:52px">Share the document, not the person.</div>
  <div style="margin-top:70px;font-size:32px;color:#dbe4ff">github.com/bananabbgun/RedactAgent</div>
</section>

</body></html>
